#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/column_width.rst:5
msgid "Column width definition"
msgstr "列宽定义"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/column_width.rst:7
msgid ""
"The width from a `column`_ can only be defined from the column head, the top"
" cell from the `drawing area`_ which gives the width value from the "
"corresponding `column`_. The head from the `columns`_ is not displayed in "
"the `folio`_, it is only displayed at `title block editor`_."
msgstr ""
"从 `栏 <column_>`_ 的宽度只能从列头来定义，从 `绘图区 <drawing area_>`_ 的上方单元格给出了相应的 `栏 "
"<column_>`_ 的宽度值。`栏 <columns_>`_ 的宽度没有在 `图幅 <folio_>`_ 中显示，只在 `图框编辑器 <title "
"block editor_>`_ 中显示。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/column_width.rst:11
msgid "Double click on column head to display the column width PopUp window."
msgstr "双击列头显示列宽 PopUp 窗口 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/column_width.rst:16
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Title block column width PopUP window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 图框宽度"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/column_width.rst:18
msgid ""
"Select the click button corresponding to the desired units to define the "
"column width (Absolute, relative to total, relative to remainding)."
msgstr "选择与想要的单位相对应的点击按钮，以定义列宽(绝对，相对于总数，相对于保留)."

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/column_width.rst:19
msgid "Define the width value."
msgstr "定义宽度值。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/column_width.rst:20
msgid "Press **OK**."
msgstr "按 **OK**."

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/column_width.rst:24
#, python-format
msgid ""
"The global width from the `title block`_ has to be defined at QElectroTech, "
"for this reason, defining one column width as remanding of 100% is "
"recommended."
msgstr ""
"从 `图框 <title block_>`_ 的全局宽度必须在QEelectroTech中定义，为此，将一个列宽定义为推荐的100% is还原。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/column_width.rst:30
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Title block"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 图框"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/column_width.rst:33
msgid ""
"At the case that a remanding width is not desired, be sure that the global "
"width from the `title block`_ matches with the sum of all column widths. At "
"the case that the values are not matching, QElectroTech will display the "
"`title block`_ as shown below; part of the title block header will be "
"displayed in red and the width difference will be displayed."
msgstr ""
"如果不想要还原宽度，请确定来自 `图框 <title block_>`_ 的全局宽度与所有列宽的和数相匹配。 如果值不匹配，QElectroTech "
"将显示下面显示的 `图框 <title block_>`_; 图框头部分将以红色显示，宽度差将显示 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/column_width.rst:41
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Title block global width error"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 图框全局宽度错误"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/column_width.rst:45
msgid ""
"At the case of using **Relative to remainding**, be sure that the value from"
" the width is 100 %. Otherwise, spare area will appear in the `title "
"block`_."
msgstr "在使用 **保留** 时，请确定宽度值为 100% 。 否则，空余区域将出现在 `图框 <title block_>`_ 中 。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/title_block/title_block_editor/edition/column_width.rst:51
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech Title block column width error"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 图框列宽度错误"
